hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"285","[AI-translation] Hamees Abu Salamah Yahya bin Khalaf, kahne lage: Hamees Bishr bin Al-Mufaddal, Khalid Al-Hadhdha' se, Abdullah bin Shiqiq se, kahne lage: Maine Aisha se, Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ki namaz ke baare mein poocha, toh unhon ne kaha: Wo Zuhr se pehle do rak'at aur uske baad do rak'at, aur Maghrib ke baad do rak'at, aur Isha ke baad do rak'at, aur Fajr se pehle do rak'at namaz padhte the."
